.SH "نام (NAME)"
git-lfs-post-merge \- Git post\-merge hook implementation
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
.fam C
\fBgit lfs post\-merge\fP \fI<is\-squash>\fP
.fam
.fi
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Responds to Git post\-merge events. It makes sure that any files which
are marked as lockable by \f(CRgit lfs track\fP are read\-only in the working
copy, if not currently locked by the local user.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
git\-lfs\-track(1)
.sp
Part of the git\-lfs(1) suite.